ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/briefs/1.1-rules-kernel.md:5:**Goal:** Vendor the smallest provenance-pinned Kaggriculture rules package that constructs a game from configuration and seed, executes decoded commands, exposes state and economic counters, and passes retained and replay parity tests without changing Isaiah's root crate.
ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/briefs/1.1-rules-kernel.md:7:**Architecture:** Three reference Rust implementation files form a standalone package. Remove exactly seven module declarations from `lib.rs`; preserve the other two source files and the retained RNG tests byte-for-byte. A new test-only replay harness consumes four pinned official-engine traces; a manifest checker accounts for every reference file and every permitted edit.
